{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39115","headline":"三堂东湖作 · 韦庄","name":"三堂东湖作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满塘秋水碧泓澄，十亩菱花晚镜清。\n景动新桥横蝃蝀，岸铺芳草睡鵁鶄。\n蟾投夜魄当湖落，岳倒秋莲入浪生。\n何处最添诗客兴，黄昏烟雨乱蛙声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}